+# r36-03: the 43 `other/math` refusals, bucketed by cause
+
+Round 35's run (`/tmp/r36/other-before.json`): **21 PASS / 0 FAIL / 43 UNSUPPORTED /
+1 TIMEOUT**. Every refusal had a different sentence, but they come from **22 causes**;
+one of them — the translator refusing the address of a vector element — blocks **10 of
+the 43** by itself, and the ten `ROOT::Math`/MathMore names below cover another 11.
+
+Method: read all 43 reasons plus the round-35 `run.log` of each, then reduced the
+non-obvious ones to two-to-five line `.cxx` snippets under `/tmp/r36/probe` and ran
+`python -m xrdroot run` on them. Nothing here is a guess from the message alone; the
+snippets that reproduce each cause are quoted in the detail sections. The harness was
+not run again.
+
+Sorted by tests blocked. "File" is the first file a fix would touch.
